  "planning_notes": [
    "Board is arduino:avr:uno. Wiring preserved: TM1637 CLK=D4, DIO=D5; buttons D2 and D3; DHT11 data pin D7; potentiometer connected to A0.",
    "Menu logic is handled in SysML: D2 advances the menu item, D3 confirms and then the TM1637 keeps showing the confirmed item's value until the next menu switch.",
    "DHT11 temperature, humidity, and validity share the same physical pin (D7) and sensor type. When the catalog reports invalid data, temperature/humidity retain the last valid values and validity becomes false; SysML must use the validity signal to avoid blocking unrelated devices."
