    "original_requirement": "实现一个简单的菜单式显示系统，使用 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、按钮 D2、按钮 D3、DHT11（D7）和电位器 A0。D2 用于切换菜单项，D3 用于确认；菜单包括显示温度、显示湿度、显示电位器值三项，确认后持续显示对应值直到再次切换。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个简单的菜单式显示系统，使用 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、按钮 D2、按钮 D3、DHT11（D7）和电位器 A0。D2 用于切换菜单项，D3 用于确认；菜单包括显示温度、显示湿度、显示电位器值三项，确认后持续显示对应值直到再次切换。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v1\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"dht\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": null}",
